WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.600
Stuck Together by a Mysterious Light

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:46.470
You ate the eel bread that I was looking forward to, didn't you?!

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:49.980
And you taped over my video, didn't you?!

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:55.360
The final episode of "Fuyu no Donata", looks familiar, doesn't it?

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.650
You don't need to get so upset over a video!

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:01.410
Come on.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:04.620
If we don't hurry and go…

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.120
we'll be late.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:10.160
Good job.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:14.210
Who cares about that video? You can just tape it again, right?

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.340
Look who's talking when you're so angry about me eating some bread!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:17.630
What?

00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:18.210
Geez!

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:20.430
My long awaited eel bread!

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.890
My long awaited "Fuyu no Donata"!

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:25.470
Give me back my eel bread!

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.970
They sure get along in the morning.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:28.100
Amateur goddess, as well as the Sun God!

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.640
Typical of you girls.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:34.560
Considering the time, you should be rushing to school to not be late.

00:02:33.350 --> 00:02:34.730
Wait!

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:39.530
If that bread was so important, you should have put your name on it!

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:43.910
Realizing this, you should realize the foolishness of leaving so many openings so early in the morning.

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:44.170
You too! If I taped over your video, why not just buy the damn DVD?

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:44.620
Hey!

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.040
Listen when someone is talking!

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.830
Karasuma.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.540
Good morning, glasses guy.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.250
I'm not "good morning, glasses guy"!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.000
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:56.840
Here I come.

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:01.300
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:07.720
Karin, stand back.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.640
You're thinking I stand in the way again.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.100
I can fight too!

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.770
Thick-headed woman.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.110
I don't want to hear that from a crybaby.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.690
Ego sumo deus!

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:22.780
I am God!

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:33.290
I can't…

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:34.750
transform.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.470
What's going on here?

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.220
Why won't it come off?

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.020
What on earth is this?

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.200
What are they doing?

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:12.580
Could this be a new technique?

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:16.290
If so, I'll have to retreat for now.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:27.970
When you look at you two like that, it looks like you really get along well.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.800
How so?

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.760
There's no way.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:38.100
Jeez, why are our rings stuck together?

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.520
I can't be seen by Kirika-senpai like this.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.070
Their moves this morning…

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:45.990
Was that an appearance technique?

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:48.030
It was undoubtedly a new technique.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.290
To connect their hands!? How can it be one?!

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:04.090
What are they planning?

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.970
Karin-chan, what's up with that?

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:09.390
Is it a new magic trick?

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:10.890
Won't they loosen?

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:14.140
No, ehm…

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:16.890
Isn't there a better way to hide it?

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:19.520
This is all I have, I can't help it!

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:28.820
Hey! My seat is this way.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:32.370
Yes, but my seat is over here.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:45.960
Huh? I didn't think you two were seated next to each other, right?

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:48.380
Ehm…

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:49.590
This is, well…

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:57.100
I forgot my first and second period textbook!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.020
Oh, yes!

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:03.230
I forgot my third and fourth period textbook, so…

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:06.150
What perfect timing! Let's go get them together!

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.740
I see.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.070
It can't be helped then.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:17.620
A normal person wouldn't forget something like that.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:21.210
It doesn't matter, it worked somehow…

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:34.550
Huh? Hanazono-san, Kujyou-kun…

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:36.470
why are you holding hands?

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.310
- Stop it, Micchi!

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.310
- What are you doing?!

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:44.190
Eh? They were holding hands the entire time?

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.110
That's because, this is… um…

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.070
This presence can only be…

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.570
Wait a minute, Hanazono-san.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:56.620
What does that hand…

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:58.490
mean?

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:02.710
- <i>I can't think up an excuse in this situation!</i>

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:02.410
- Well, this is…

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.210
This is from Hii-bachan's will.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:13.970
Actually, for generations, according to family tradition,…

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:15.970
on an ancestor's death anniversary,…

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:19.970
we have to hold hands with someone who shares the same first character of your name.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:25.150
I'm pretty sure that's not going to work.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.030
Why are they crying?

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:37.530
To protect your family's tradition!

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:40.290
Why did your ancestors wish something so harsh!

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.000
I'm falling for you more and more!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.550
Hey, don't pull!

00:07:57.550 --> 00:08:01.270
Ah, you made me forget what I was writing because you said something!

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:03.060
Geez!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.440
Hey! You erased my bit as well!

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:14.740
Sorry.

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:16.610
Now he's done it.

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:18.410
Okay, say "ahh".

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:31.210
You did that on purpose, right?

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.210
As did you.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:43.430
I didn't think school could be so tiring.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:48.690
What's wrong?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.610
This is bad.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:51.610
I need to use the bathroom.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:57.570
You're a boy, so bear with it!

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.030
Don't ask for the impossible.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:05.040
I'm not going in the boys' bathroom!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.410
Don't move so much!

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.040
It can't be helped.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.710
It's not going to get any better if I don't go.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.760
This can't be!

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:19.390
I don't get it.

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.810
Why were they walking in while holding hands?

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:29.770
Could it mean… they've started going out!?

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:42.450
Speaking of the devil…

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:50.250
What are they doing in front of the boys' bathroom?

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:56.460
They went in!!!

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:05.930
Them holding hands… and going into the boys' bathroom…

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:09.060
what on earth are they doing?

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:11.880
Student Council Office

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:25.120
Nii-san.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:27.450
Are you worried about Kujyou-kun and the others again?

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:28.870
Yeah.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:33.330
You're head is always full of ways to fight them.

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:39.010
No, at the moment I'm not that worried about how to crush them.

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:45.260
Instead, my head is full of thoughts as to what relation exists between them.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.470
But, don't push yourself too far.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:50.690
I guess you're right.

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:55.520
If those two are in that kind of relationship…

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:58.650
then could that light from this morning be…

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:00.570
the Light of Love?

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:07.120
The Light of Love…

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:12.080
You're over-worked after all, nii-san.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:18.880
Hey! Don't run so fast!

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:21.920
We have a P.E. test next, right?

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:23.510
We have to go and change, quickly.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:26.850
Where are we supposed to change?

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.010
In the changing room of cou-

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.390
Which changing room?

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:40.940
Thank goodness, there's nobody here.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:44.360
This is the equipment storeroom, right?

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.280
Let's hurry.

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:48.370
With what?

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:49.910
Come on.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.250
You change first.

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:56.710
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:00.250
I am God!

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:05.210
You moron.

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:05.210
It's a croquette!

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:09.430
Are we changing here?!

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.390
I'll look the other way, so harry up.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:14.690
But…

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.560
It can't be helped.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:18.110
We can't go to the changing room.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:21.480
Make sure you don't look over here, okay?

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:22.740
I know.

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.780
I'll beat you up if you look…

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.070
I won't look!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:33.710
To change clothes here, with Kazune-kun,…

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:36.080
it's so embarrassing!

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:39.540
Hey.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:47.680
Nii-san.

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:51.760
Could you get the balls from the equipment storeroom?

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:53.180
Sure.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:01.270
My arm doesn't twist that way.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:05.030
Well, you should stop pulling, Kazune-kun!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:08.570
Hey, stop touching weird places!

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.910
I'm not touching them!

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:17.790
No, no.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:21.040
I have to prepare the next P.E. class.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:38.270
The Light of Love.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:41.690
I'm sorry!

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:46.190
Was that… glasses guy?

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:51.070
I get the feeling I'm taking part in one big misunderstanding.

00:13:56.410 --> 00:14:00.960
Doing that on this student council president's; Karasuma Kirio's sacred around!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.040
What a thing…

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.340
Huh?

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.090
Where are the balls, nii-san?

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:12.140
The Light… of Love…

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:14.600
Nii-san…

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:21.060
Right, from now we'll be starting the dancing test.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:25.530
What should I do? Can we dance properly under these circumstances?

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.780
Kazune-kun.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.330
Karin, it'll be alright.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.790
Leave it to me.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.420
Here we go, Karin.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:44.630
Okay.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.470
Kazune-cha-a-an.

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:55.890
Karin-cha-a-an.

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:58.560
Go for it…

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.610
Huh?

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:13.660
What's going on?

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:18.450
Somehow, we're dancing so naturally.

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.040
That's magnificent!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.050
As expected from Kujyou-kun!

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.960
Bravo, Hanazono-san!

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:34.760
This is strange.

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:40.850
I have the feeling that his talent is given to me through his hand.

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:59.290
It's as if I've been with Kazune-kun for ages.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:21.100
Hey, are you okay?

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:23.640
Yes, I'm fine.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.770
Are you okay, Kazune-kun?

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.730
I sprained my foot a little.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:45.370
I'm sorry.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:50.550
Because I fell during the dance test…

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.590
you sprained your foot.

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.920
Don't worry.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:56.050
It isn't that bad.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:02.970
Nevertheless, today was the worst.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:09.360
It was somewhat tiring.

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:12.480
We fought since this morning.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.280
We caused such an uproar.

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:20.990
I'm sorry… for eating your bread.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:22.660
That doesn't matter anymore.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:30.380
And anyway… I'm also sorry… for erasing that video.

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:34.550
That's okay, that drama will rerun one day anyway.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:43.100
If we were to be stuck forever like this, what would we do?

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:49.690
I can't marry Kirika-senpai if I'm stuck to you like this.

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:53.940
Even though I wanted to become Kirika-senpai's wife.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.150
Just kidding.

00:17:58.200 --> 00:18:01.570
When that time comes, I'll marry you.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.410
Just kidding.

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:08.330
Thanks.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:13.210
Huh?

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:19.680
Since when did it loosen?

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:30.020
Hasn't Kazune-kun noticed?

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:38.900
Or… has he noticed?

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:51.920
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:56.840
I've found you, Light of Love!

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:01.130
Or should I say, amateur goddess.

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:06.260
The fact that they're still holding hands means…

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:10.060
that they've held hands the entire day?

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:16.480
As the student council president of this sacred school…

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:20.950
I can't forgive filthy students such as you two!

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:24.910
Prepare yourselves!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.290
Kazune-kun, leave this to me.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.170
Karin.

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.540
I am God!

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:08.240
I won't be lead astray by your Light of Love anymore.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:09.450
Eat this!

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.670
Why are you saying stuff I don't understand?

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.500
You peeping glasses guy!

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:22.010
Peeping glasses guy?

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:27.260
I-I'm not "peeping glasses guy".

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:28.930
I'm Karasuma Kiri-

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:30.520
You peeped, didn't you?!

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:35.810
No, that's not true!

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:38.650
What's not true?!

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:44.570
It's not true!!!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:48.160
Victory.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:00.920
I wonder why I got stuck to Kazune-kun's hand.

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:28.870
You ate the eel bread that I was looking forward to again, didn't you?!

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:33.450
You too! I finally taped the rerun of the final episode of "Fuyu no Donata"…

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:35.500
and you erased it again!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.290
Come on.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:44.510
If we don't hurry, we'll be late.

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.380
Good job.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:56.270
I'm… not a peeping glasses guy.

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:58.940
I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:01.060
Nii-san…

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:09.490
Geez, you're such a dense girl.

00:22:09.490 --> 00:22:13.830
What about you?! You don't have to get so annoyed over a melodrama!

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:16.540
Wait!..

00:22:16.540 --> 00:22:18.400
If that was such an important bread…

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:21.330
In the end, the reason for the rings to stick together,…

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:25.050
and the reason for them returning to normal, is unknown.

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:26.710
I wonder what that was about.

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.600
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.600
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.130
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.130
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.370
Adieu, Karin-chan's First Love

00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:07.880
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:07.880 --> 00:24:11.240
Adieu, Karin-chan's first love.

00:24:11.240 --> 00:24:14.110
They say "Adieu" means goodbye.

00:24:14.110 --> 00:24:16.950
So "Goodbye, first love" will mean that I…

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:19.660
will part with Kirika-senpai?!
